en_in_extra.txt is TileShell's own short list of Indian English words (places,
festivals, food, common names) that the AOSP list lacks.

mr_words.txt and hi_words.txt are word frequencies counted, by
tools/keyboard/build_indic_wordlist.py, from:
  - Tatoeba's Marathi and Hindi sentences (https://tatoeba.org), CC-BY 2.0 FR;
  - Mozilla Common Voice's Marathi and Hindi sentence collections
    (https://github.com/common-voice/common-voice, server/data), CC0 1.0. mr_extra.txt and hi_extra.txt are
TileShell's own short lists of places and festivals the sentences lack.

emoji.txt is built from Unicode's emoji-test.txt (https://unicode.org/Public/emoji/
latest/emoji-test.txt), © Unicode, Inc., under the Unicode terms of use
(https://www.unicode.org/terms_of_use.html), by tools/keyboard/build_emoji.py.
en_chat_extra.txt is TileShell's own list of everyday chat words.
